      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Bulk Cold Email List Verifier (MX, SMTP & Catch-All Filter Before Instantly/Smartlead)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nVerify email deliverability, DNS MX records, and catch-all status inside n8n before pushing leads to Instantly or Smartlead.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/bulk-email-verifier-cleaner`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/bulk-email-verifier-cleaner) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Bulk Email Verifier & Validator - MX & SMTP** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "d3ff0a94-cbf7-4626-ad33-fbc27e09c6e2",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
